# ENEMY 2 (built-in)
training 0x7EC8B39A "ENEMY 2"
builtin

step "-Damage the enemy to STUN it."                                            until scuttles_stun >= 1
step "-When STUNNED, they will ATTACK after a short time if you are close."     until scuttles_attack >= 1
step "-Keep the enemy STUNNED or finish it with additional damage."             until scuttles_stunned >= 3
step "-DASH or JUMP in to a STUNNED enemy to finish it and BOOST off it."       until scuttles_boost >= 6

keep 1 scuttles every 1
